# Who may do what. The edge box can only send; the server can only listen (and send the seat map).
# ExamGuard also encrypts every payload with EXAMGUARD_MQTT_KEY, so these rules are a second lock.
user edge
topic write examguard/+/incident
topic write examguard/+/status
topic write examguard/+/live/+
topic write examguard/+/snap/+
topic read  examguard/+/seatmap

user server
topic read  examguard/+/incident
topic read  examguard/+/status
topic read  examguard/+/live/+
topic read  examguard/+/snap/+
topic write examguard/+/seatmap
